# oracle: fix adapt on pair meam scale (Fe-Ti MEAM of w107meam_fetibr): the embedding energy of type 1 times scale[1][1] (its F' unscaled, meam_dens_final.cpp) and the 1-2 pair's energy and force times scale[1][2] (meam_force.cpp), ramped every 3 steps over 30 steps of nve
# oracle-inputs: w107meam_fetic_lib.meam w107meam_fetibr.meam
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all rel=1e-9 abs=1e-12
units           metal
atom_style      atomic
boundary        p p p
lattice         hcp 2.92
region          box block 0 3 0 3 0 3 units lattice
create_box      2 box
create_atoms    1 box
set atom 1 type 2
set atom 5 type 2
set atom 9 type 2
set atom 20 type 2
set atom 33 type 2
mass            1 47.880
mass            2 55.847
pair_style      meam
pair_coeff      * * w107meam_fetic_lib.meam Fe Ti w107meam_fetibr.meam Ti Fe
velocity        all create 300.0 87287 loop geom
variable        a equal 1.0-0.005*elapsed
variable        b equal 1.0+0.01*elapsed
fix             1 all nve
fix             2 all adapt 3 pair meam scale 1 1 v_a pair meam scale 1 2 v_b
timestep        0.001
thermo_style    custom step temp pe press
thermo_modify   format float %.15g norm no
thermo          10
run             30
